        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ஏற்றுமதி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஏற்றுமதி — ēṟṟumati — \"exports\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தேயிலை இந்த மாவட்டத்தின் முக்கியமான ஏற்றுமதி. tēyilai inta māvaṭṭattiṉ mukkiyamāṉa ēṟṟumati. Tea is the main export of this district."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With செய் (cey) it becomes a verb: ஏற்றுமதி (ēṟṟumati) செய், to export."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஏற்றுமதி (ēṟṟumati) is built on the native ஏற்று (ēṟṟu), \"to load, to put on board\"; the origin of the second part, -மதி, is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
