          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இறக்குமதி (iṟakkumati) is built on the native இறக்கு (iṟakku), \"to unload, to bring down\"; as with ஏற்றுமதி (ēṟṟumati), the origin of -மதி is not settled."
